      "category": "other",
      "title": "KONG Wubba",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "\\-- More specifically, [my pup\nMolly](http://www.fourhournewsletter.com/click.html?x=a62e&lc=wCs&mc=e&s=bomwH&u=w&y=R&)\nis loving this. She has methodically destroyed every “indestructible” dog toy\nI’ve given her, except this and perhaps 1-2 others. It’s also easy to throw\nlong distances without getting your hands slobbered. The only (potential)\ndownside: an incredibly loud squeaker. If it starts to bother me, I just\nimagine what a particularly serious friend’s face would look like if Molly\nwere chomping the Wubba as he tried to finish the last bit of a crossword\npuzzle. That enough to make me laugh at the racket.",
